OL,3,GNEWSAFenwick Christmas window's
OL,4,AGruffalo theme revealed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands have tuned in to watch the
OL,7,Funveiling of this year's Fenwick's
OL,8,FChristmas window.
OL,10,FThe theme at the Newcastle department
OL,11,Fstore took its inspiration from Dame
OL,12,FJulia Donaldson's The Gruffalo's Child.
OL,14,FDame Donaldson said she was "delighted"
OL,15,Fher book would be part of creating
OL,16,Fspecial memories for families in the
OL,17,Fcity this year. "It's wonderful to see
OL,18,FThe Gruffalo's Child brought to life in
OL,19,Fsuch a magical way," she said.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
